{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-06_beg","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-06","title":"疑兵之计","storyCode":"5-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"acba3a88ee971ac3934774fa1e51359f6f210d36292a889259cbdc2ae6e86d1d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_emporium"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"不对劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你又要干什么，病发了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"这和切尔诺伯格完全不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我们损失不小，但我们战胜切尔诺伯格人的过程中，也看到了那些敌人的挣扎，还有那些帮凶逃窜的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这龙门却像座空城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"难道不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"大古广场，这么大的大楼，这么多的商铺，却一个人都没有啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我逛了一圈，昂贵的商品都只剩下标牌了！都被拿走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"爱国者不是说过，不允许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是那个意思。你知道，梅菲斯特随便我们干什么，但这不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"我是说，好像有人提前把这些东西收起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你又在瞎想了。龙门束手无策！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我们从各处突然涌了出来，哪里都有我们，*乌萨斯粗口*，就像在切尔诺伯格时一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这回我们不毁掉它，我们要夺下它，把它当做我们的城市！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"知道什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"大古广场是离近卫局最近的据点，从这里很快就能赶到近卫局，支援他们也很方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"上次通报讲过了，我听过这段。其他的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"各处的整合运动理应在近卫局附近汇合，然后向外扩散，接管整座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是很清楚我们周遭队伍的分布......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"但其他区域的队伍呢？我知道很多支队伍都正向近卫局这里移动，但更多的队伍消失了，消失得无影无踪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"消失......是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"很神秘。他们的话筒开着，却一点声音都没传出来。我们没法联系上他们了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"马上也没人能联系上你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，谁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"窗户！在窗户外面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"有敌人！敌人在攻击我们，近卫局，是近卫局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，是近卫局没错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶！难道是从顶楼挂绳下来，跳进窗户的吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"战斗！动起来！我们的人数远比他们多，消灭他们就行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯，给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes sir！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局听好！把整合运动连同他们的掩体统统砸个粉碎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":true,"text":"（龙门粗口），你要干嘛？！大古广场是我家的财产！你凭什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，“小姐”，整合运动负隅顽抗，先摧毁他们的战斗力才是第一优先级......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么！！！你这条仆街龙！！你！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局！进攻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我的天。哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你们注意点，这怎么说也是市民财产。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那台钢琴他们没抬走，估计太重了。但值个一百八十万龙门币，“小姐”向我吹嘘过的，小心点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"你们跑不了了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"找掩体！快！躲在那架钢琴后面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"它打破了我们的掩体！转移！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"一百八十万......炸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"其他同胞，其他同胞！听着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我们占据了龙门的大古广场作为据点，也做好了防御准备，但近卫局从广场高层突袭了我们！他们正在削减我们的人数！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"通报！！近卫局的主力，在大古广场！大古广场！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"汇报完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么时候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你已经汇报完毕了，那你的任务就已经完成了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"让整个龙门的整合运动都知道我们在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们等着他们来，等着他们追逐我们，等着和他们在近卫局决一死战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局！继续攻击！别停火！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["诗怀雅","陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","aliases":["整合运动术师"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["诗怀雅"]}]}
